%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:222 (writeXml-escapeCR-test)
testing: escapeCR false (default) — CR characters preserved as-is
元の形: io/writeXml の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
write({"root": {"text": "line1\r\nline2"}}, "application/xml", {"escapeCR": false})
%%% output application/json
"<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>\n<root>\n  <text>line1\r\nline2</text>\n</root>"
